= 22 July 1974 — Before the ceasefire

[+ cyprus_atilla1_briefing +]

Previous report: [+ cyprus_atilla1_last_text +]

- @historical: Historical: Accept the ceasefire and pursue the junction—or secure its flanks if already established—before the deadline.
- @alternative: Alternative: Accept the ceasefire and halt offensive movement immediately.

